      "text": "requirements: \n  -> plug & play model: able to add our engine with\n                            another sys with minimal changes.\n  -> extendible : sms, email, pop-up etc.\n  -> able to edit dynamically (like changing color etc)\n  -> store all Notifications/ logging",
